style.fill: "#17181b"
*.style: { font-size: 20; bold: false; fill: "#23252a"; stroke: "#747a85"; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; border-radius: 6 }
(* -> *)[*].style: { stroke: "#fc5b05"; stroke-width: 2; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; font-size: 16 }
grid-rows: 2
grid-columns: 3
horizontal-gap: 96
vertical-gap: 100
visitor: Visitor\nLeaves a contribution { shape: person }
pending: Here / there · pending\nPrivate record + media { shape: document }
owner: Invited owner\nAuthenticated review { shape: person }
original: Here / there · original\nVisibility checked now\nHide / delete revokes access { shape: document }
card: Linkarooie · curated card\nKeeps the source item ID
approved: Here / there · approved\nProvider-eligible contribution
visitor -> pending: submit
pending -> owner: review
owner -> approved: approve
approved -> card: public ID
card -> original: open source
